        <div class="notes" id="notes-7685230" data-guid="7685230"></div>
        <div id="questions-7685230" data-guid="7685230" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685230_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Added <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">9-9-2004</span> by <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 17.42.04</span></span><a class="footnoteref" href="#ft7685230-1" id="ref7685230-1">[1]</a>]</div><div class="para">This article is further subject to § <a class="xref" guid="7684788" href="7684788#7684788">323-75</a> of the Code of the City of Albany, stating that the Commissioner of the Department of General Services is hereby authorized to promulgate and amend a fee schedule and additional rules, regulations and specifications necessary to supplement and effectuate the purpose and intent of this article.</div><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7685230-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7685230-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor's Note: This ordinance also redesignated former §§ 345-13 through 345-16 as 345-22 through 345-25, respectively.</div></div></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7685231 child"
      id="7685231"
      data-guid="7685231"
      data-parent-guid="7685174"
      data-position="7741"
