        <div class="notes" id="notes-7685231" data-guid="7685231"></div>
        <div id="questions-7685231" data-guid="7685231" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685231_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Should any section, clause or provisions of this article be declared by the courts to be invalid, the same shall not affect the validity of the article as a whole or parts thereof, other than the part so declared to be invalid.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="positioned contentTitle mediumTitle articleTitle 7685232 customerTitleColor"
