Purpose.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7685233" data-guid="7685233"></div>
        <div id="questions-7685233" data-guid="7685233" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685233_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">This Common Council, recognizing the need for encouraging and promoting programs relating to conservation of natural and ecological resources and, by appropriate action, to coordinate the same to the current economic problems, does hereby determine the authority herein granted to be in the public interest; and that in furtherance of the aforesaid and in accordance with the <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/GMU/" target="_blank">General Municipal Law</a> of the State of New York, this Council does herewith authorize the use of available unimproved lands owned by the City for the cultivation of the soil upon such lands for planting and maintaining gardens and growing food crops thereon.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7685234 child"
      id="7685234"
      data-guid="7685234"
      data-parent-guid="7685232"
      data-position="7744"
      data-full-title="§ 345-24: Authorization to enter into agreement for services."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7685234_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7685234_label" for="7685234_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7685234"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 345-24
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7685234"
    >
Authorization to enter into agreement for services.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7685234" data-guid="7685234"></div>
        <div id="questions-7685234" data-guid="7685234" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685234_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Mayor of the City of Albany is hereby authorized to enter into an agreement for ground preparation of approximately 500 gardens, seed purchases, gardening classes, food preparation and such other related services as may be required.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7685235 child"
      id="7685235"
      data-guid="7685235"
      data-parent-guid="7685232"
      data-position="7745"
