        <div class="notes" id="notes-7685235" data-guid="7685235"></div>
        <div id="questions-7685235" data-guid="7685235" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685235_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Such rules and regulations as may be needed shall be promulgated and established for public guidance, including setting such fee as may be deemed necessary for the exclusive use of a designated plot of land for the purpose intended. Such fee shall entitle a resident to preparation of the plot for planting, seeds required for a basic garden, instruction by qualified personnel, etc.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </main>
